  },
  "a320": {
   "cfm56_5b4": "CFM56-5B4 take-off rating 27,000 lbf (120 kN): CFM International; EASA TCDS E.003 (CFM56-5B/-5C).",
   "a320_tofl": "A320-200, MTOW 78 t, sea level ISA: take-off field length about 2,090-2,100 m (certified, one engine inoperative and 1.15 x all-engines distance, whichever is longer); e.g. https://www.skytamer.com/Airbus_A320.html, https://aircraftinvestigation.info/airplanes/Airbus_A320-200_CFM56.html (which also quotes about 1,825 m at 73.5 t); secondary sources. The primary source, Airbus' A320 Aircraft Characteristics - Airport and Maintenance Planning, was not checked (it could not be opened from the environment of this study)."
  },
